  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your tail is equally good at tripping opponents as it is at hurting them.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Whiptail (Combat), base attack bonus +6, gnorri.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you make an attack with your tail, you can make a trip attempt as a free action that does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You can’t normally make a trip attempt with your tail.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythos-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
